    "sections": {
      "Highlights": "THIS\u2026 is a 2022 BMW M5 CS, finished in Brands Hatch Grey Metallic with a Black and Mugello Red interior. According to the Monroney Label provided in the gallery, factory equipment includes an electronic transfer case with rear-wheel and all-wheel-drive modes, adaptive suspension, auto-dimming and power-folding side mirrors, 16-speaker Harman/Kardon stereo system, and more as detailed below. The seller mentions no modifications. The \"F90\" M5 CS is the first CS version of the M5. The increased use of carbon fiber and other lightweight materials resulted in a 256-pound diet over the regular F90 M5. It wears a special trim called \"Gold Bronze,\" which is visible on the wheels and grille surrounds. The M5 CS also boasts an increase in horsepower with a 2.8 second 0 to 60 mph time and an electronically limited top speed of 155 miles per hour. Power comes from a 4.4-liter turbocharged V8 engine, which produces 627 horsepower and 553 lb-ft of torque. Power is sent to all four or the rear wheels via an 8-speed transmission.",
      "Equipment": "A Monroney Label is provided in the photo gallery, and a partial list of notable equipment includes: 20-inch BMW Style 798M wheels Electronic transfer case with rear-wheel and all-wheel-drive modes 3.15 rear axle ratio Double wishbone front suspension Adaptive tuned suspension with driver control functionality Auto-dimming and power-folding side-view mirrors Laser supplement auto-leveling headlights LED brake lights M carbon bucket front seats with 10-way power adjustment Remote engine start 600w, 16-speaker Harman/Kardon stereo system Wi-fi hotspot Apple CarPlay and Android Auto compatibility",
      "Seller Notes": "There is a loan on this vehicle. Sale proceeds will be used to satisfy the loan and allow the seller to transfer the title to the winning bidder. Please contact the seller directly with any questions. The seller reports that the scratch on the splitter occured during transport from Germany."
